      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16768/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel plantain and cut into 1-inch slices. Fill a bowl with 3 cups of cold water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IqsN9P6tZfjjKuDaLBbpzhnOfJk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-16768-Puerto-Rican-Tostones-Fried-Plantains-4x3-step-2-2cb4c1a8735444beace7dc3902112436.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16768/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large deep skillet over medium-high heat; add plantain slices in an even layer and fry on both sides until golden brown, about 3 1/2 minutes per side. Set skillet aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NZ-tB0Ril5A5iE1o5jdv2U38FS8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-16768-Puerto-Rican-Tostones-Fried-Plantains-4x3-step-03-3033d978c32247f581bfe08bfec4c310.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16768/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer plantain slices to a chopping board; flatten each one by placing a small plate on top and pressing down.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gJPrSehzvU9MTOQH6AKxDd7LUAU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-16768-Puerto-Rican-Tostones-Fried-Plantains-4x3-step-04-7d1850ff723f46e6947b3b7ddae3ec3f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16768/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip plantain slices in cold water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UwszoJ4reSkXrHhEpNGKnhPXlyo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-16768-Puerto-Rican-Tostones-Fried-Plantains-4x3-step-05-2-10a0148622534bfcbd3573a2d28d031d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16768/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reheat oil in the skillet over medium heat; cook plantain slices for 1 minute on each side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1Iz3YvFnWtR3usQlJzi1mwGaV9E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-16768-Puerto-Rican-Tostones-Fried-Plantains-4x3-step-06-0d3c762a2d5040598530d6b98ca55a00.jpg"
